{"id":"vod_md_3421","vodId":"3421","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"可塑性记忆","name_cn":"可塑性记忆","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230827-1/b2879c33fe58767a39c08722909c9b04.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在科技飞速发展的未来世界，彼时，人工智能机器人早已经不是罕见之物，正慢慢地融入人类的生活之中。高考落榜之后，十八岁的青年水柿司（内匠靖明 配音）在父母的帮助下来到了SAI社工作，SAI社的主要产品即是名为“Giftia”的人形智能机器人。水柿司被安排到了终端部门工作，来到办公室后水柿司才发现，这个部门的主要职责竟然是回收即将报废的机器人。在这里，水柿司结识了名为艾拉（雨宫天 配音）的少女，她其实正是一名机器人，艾拉外表冷漠不善言其，却有着意外可爱的一面。就这样，水柿司和艾拉成为了工作中的搭档，两人之间渐渐产生了真挚的友谊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-27 09:14:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/sNGICtEM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/ZIozJYE2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/NjySe7r5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/U2c0Kt1r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/E3tNLXS4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/vZBevBVB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/YTG40bGE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/4jrRCHZC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/B2O6JAVY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/ntLHRFGz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/CeROnXou/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/4d15wWda/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230824/7VgstjQ3/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:09.563Z"}